import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 609 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation · Overview | Law-Network Time-Flow-Rate Control","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 609 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation · Overview | Law-Network Time-Flow-Rate Control","no":609,"module":3,"tags":["Time Domain","Technical Implementation","Law Network","Time Flow Rate","Overview"],"related":["13-Spatial Jurisprudence Scheduling System Details","16-Multiplication Fruit Technical Principle","62-Spatial Jurisprudence Technical Implementation"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0609_模块3-时间域技术实现总论-法则网络时间流速调控.md","filePath":"en/0609_模块3-时间域技术实现总论-法则网络时间流速调控.md"}'),o={name:"en/0609_模块3-时间域技术实现总论-法则网络时间流速调控.md"};function r(l,e,s,c,h,u){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-609-time-domain-technical-implementation-·-overview-law-network-time-flow-rate-control" tabindex="-1">Entry 609 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation · Overview | Law-Network Time-Flow-Rate Control <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-609-time-domain-technical-implementation-·-overview-law-network-time-flow-rate-control" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 609 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation · Overview | Law-Network Time-Flow-Rate Control&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 13, 16, 62 | Series: Time-Domain Technical Implementation (Entry 1 · Overview)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-turning-a-bit-faster-from-a-wish-into-an-engineering-metric" tabindex="-1">Introduction: turning &quot;a bit faster&quot; from a wish into an engineering metric <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-turning-a-bit-faster-from-a-wish-into-an-engineering-metric" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: turning &quot;a bit faster&quot; from a wish into an engineering metric&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The preceding eight entries explained from civilizational critique why the dual-track time domain is &quot;dual.&quot; From this entry we enter &quot;how to build it.&quot; Any cultivator&#39;s offhand &quot;make me 100× faster&quot; behind it is a whole set of law-network engineering. Heng Yuan Zhou refuses to gloss over with &quot;divine artifact,&quot; &quot;array&quot; — per law-first axiom, <strong>time flow rate must be a definable, anchor-able, monitorable, rollback-able engineering object</strong>, not a metaphysical whim at the protagonist&#39;s thought. This entry gives the technical master framework of time-flow-rate control.</p><p>Six top-level axioms are engineering&#39;s constitution: anti-predation axiom requires flow-rate control only act on incremental R&amp;D zones, not on others; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires flow gears be applicable to Myriad Ranks; collective ascension axiom requires control results flow back to the Alaya Network; causal self-discipline axiom requires any flow-rate change leave traces throughout; law-first axiom requires law definition first, engineering landing after, never retcon. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Technology serves axioms, not the reverse.</p><h2 id="i-the-time-layer-within-the-four-layer-structure" tabindex="-1">I. The Time Layer Within the Four-Layer Structure <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-time-layer-within-the-four-layer-structure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Time Layer Within the Four-Layer Structure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per the Anchor four-layer structure (material plane / energy layer / consciousness domain / law network), time-flow-rate control occurs at the <strong>law-network layer</strong>, downward affecting the consciousness domain and material plane. Its tech stack top-down:</p><ol><li><strong>Law definition layer</strong>: mathematically define &quot;time flow rate,&quot; &quot;causal boundary,&quot; &quot;experience preservation&quot; in language, legislated by the Anchor Council (see Entry 618).</li><li><strong>Law anchoring layer</strong>: solidify abstract law into executable anchor nodes, deployed at isolated-space boundaries (Document 62).</li><li><strong>Consciousness/material action layer</strong>: inside isolated spaces, separately calibrate the consciousness domain&#39;s subjective time and the material plane&#39;s physical time.</li><li><strong>Monitoring audit layer</strong>: the Alaya Network real-time reads flow rate, load, experience-sense data; anomalies warn immediately.</li></ol><p>These four layers are indispensable: only law anchoring without monitoring is running naked; only monitoring without law definition is shooting from the hip.</p><h2 id="ii-three-technical-knobs-of-flow-rate-control" tabindex="-1">II. Three Technical Knobs of Flow-Rate Control <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-three-technical-knobs-of-flow-rate-control" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Three Technical Knobs of Flow-Rate Control&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain and Quest Sediment Domain share the same tech foundation, differing only in &quot;knob direction.&quot; Three core knobs:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Knob</th><th>Action</th><th>Acceleration-Domain Orientation</th><th>Quest-Domain Orientation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Subjective Time Multiplier</td><td>Individual consciousness&#39;s time feeling</td><td>10–1000× acceleration</td><td>0.1–1× deceleration/slowing</td></tr><tr><td>Material Time Multiplier</td><td>Domain-internal physical process time</td><td>Synchronously accelerate</td><td>Synchronously slow</td></tr><tr><td>Causal Coupling</td><td>Tightness of causal coupling with outside</td><td>High isolation (prevent overheating)</td><td>Medium isolation (preserve experience)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The key engineering problem is <strong>subjective-objective time synchronization</strong>: consciousness fast while material slow produces the tearing feeling of &quot;brain finished but body not caught up&quot;; both fast makes energy use soar. The engineering solution is to lock the two by the same multiplier, with a buffer layer absorbing drift in between.</p><h2 id="iii-relationship-with-multiplication-fruit-technology" tabindex="-1">III. Relationship with Multiplication-Fruit Technology <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-relationship-with-multiplication-fruit-technology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Relationship with Multiplication-Fruit Technology&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Time-flow-rate control is not built out of thin air; it builds on the Multiplication Fruit technical principle (Document 16). The &quot;100× deduction amplification&quot; the Multiplication Fruit provides is a consciousness-compute-level speed-up; time-flow-rate control extends this speed-up to the entire isolated space&#39;s physical time. The two are two scales of the same incremental logic: one accelerates &quot;thinking,&quot; the other accelerates &quot;doing.&quot; Engineering-wise, first verify Multiplication amplification stability in small scope (deduction iteration system, Document 11), then gradually generalize to whole-domain flow-rate control. This is precisely the engineering discipline of &quot;law first, small-step verification.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-safety-boundaries-why-cannot-the-whole-universe-be-accelerated" tabindex="-1">IV. Safety Boundaries: Why Cannot the Whole Universe Be Accelerated <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-safety-boundaries-why-cannot-the-whole-universe-be-accelerated" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Safety Boundaries: Why Cannot the Whole Universe Be Accelerated&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Can technology do &quot;tune the whole planet to 100×&quot;? Theoretically the law network can give an approximate solution, but engineering and ethics both forbid:</p><ul><li><strong>Energetics ceiling</strong>: 100× flow needs 100× law resonance share; whole-universe acceleration instantly drains the law network (see Entry 613).</li><li><strong>Causal overheating</strong>: 100× iteration = 100× causal forks, no control domain must collapse (Document 89).</li><li><strong>Experience draining</strong>: whole-domain acceleration eliminates &quot;waiting,&quot; personality thickness hollowed out.</li></ul><p>Therefore technical implementation&#39;s first principle is <strong>isolation</strong>: flow rate only takes effect within law-anchored isolated spaces; inside and outside have a clear time interface. This interface is built by the spatial jurisprudence scheduling system (Document 13).</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: flow-rate control only used for civilization high-return directions, knobs not opened in meaningless areas, eliminating whole-universe acceleration&#39;s energy drain</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: control acts on incremental R&amp;D inside isolated spaces, does not impose flow rate on others&#39; time</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s &quot;acceleration&quot; relies on divine-artifact private retention; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;acceleration&quot; relies on public, replicable law-network engineering</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: three technical knobs have adaptation gears for all five lineages; plant spirits, planet consciousness&#39;s &quot;time units&quot; have dedicated conversions</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: law definitions, anchoring parameters, monitoring algorithms all public; any merged plane may接入 by the same engineering interface</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Make time 100× faster&quot; — in predatory-faction worlds is the protagonist&#39;s talent; in Heng Yuan Zhou is a computable engineering problem. The law network&#39;s time-flow-rate control pulls metaphysics back to engineering: first define law, then anchor boundaries, then calibrate knobs, finally monitor throughout. Fast is no longer heaven-given, but civilization-built — this is precisely law-first axiom&#39;s landing at the time dimension.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/13-空间法理调度体系详解.html">Entry 13 · Spatial Jurisprudence Scheduling System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/16-倍增果实技术化原理.html">Entry 16 · Multiplication Fruit Technical Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/62-空间法理技术实现.html">Entry 62 · Spatial Jurisprudence Technical Implementation</a> · <a href="./501_模块3-双轨时间域总论.html">Entry 501 · Dual-Track Time Domain Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const g=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
